values (true, 'Chanthorn Yoeun', 'Senior Software Engineer', 'Phnom Penh, Cambodia', 'Building reliable software for complex business needs.', 'I''m Chanthorn, a software engineer with 7+ years of experience building enterprise applications, solving technical challenges, and guiding development teams.', array['Over the past 7+ years I''ve worked across backend and frontend engineering, mostly on enterprise applications such as insurance, distribution, auction, and CRM systems.', 'Alongside hands-on development, I''ve led frontend and project teams — mentoring developers, reviewing code, and working with clients and stakeholders to turn business requirements into working software.', 'I care most about software that is reliable and maintainable: clear data models, careful handling of transactions and concurrency, and code that the next developer can understand.']::text[], 'chanthorn.developer@gmail.com', null, null)
